<title>USA: Chicago Stock Exchange sets volume record in Jan.</title>
<headline>Chicago Stock Exchange sets volume record in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Stock Exchange said Tuesday its volume in January was a record 435,368,921 shares, topping its previous record by 18 percent.</p>
<p>January volume outpaced the exchange's prior all-time high monthly volume of 369,707,880 set in October 1996, it said.</p>
<p>It topped the January 1996 volume of 338,679,349 by 28.5 percent, the exchange said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
